      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "方便的話，煩請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳到\n烏羽先生的房間一趟。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
