      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的點數不足。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n請到異次元密阿雷\n完成調查課題。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
